<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Ekran year net doubles.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Ekran year net doubles.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 128.66   vs	  65.01</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 50.0    vs	  25.3</p>
<p>    Turnover		   556.35   vs	 313.70</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   201.67   vs	  93.43</p>
<p>    Minorities		   -	vs	    -</p>
<p>    Exctraordinaries	   -	vs	  40.02</p>
<p>    Dividend  (percent)	6.0    vs	   6.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Ekran Bhd is main contractor of the Bakun hydro-electric dam.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
